[ti:Old Folks at Home]
[ar:Stephen Foster]
[00:00.00]Way down upon the Swanee River
[00:18.58]Far, far away
[01:00.00]There's where my heart is turning ever
[01:07.00]There's where the old folks stay
[01:15.00]All up and down the whole creation
[01:29.00]Sadly I roam
[01:42.00]Still longing for the old plantation
[01:49.00]And for the old folks at home
